<div class="Section1">
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";
text-transform:uppercase'><a href="/"><span class="GramE">Главная</span></a> - ЕСТЕСТВЕННЫЕ
АЛЬБОМЫ
АКВАРИУМА И
БГ - Ψ - </span><span style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";text-transform:uppercase'>телохранитель<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-pagination:none"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";
color:red;layout-grid-mode:line'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New";color:red;text-transform:
uppercase'>Телохранитель<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><i><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Б.
Гребенщиков<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Вступление:
</span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>7
– 10</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>.</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V) A, D(V) A, Am G D, Am G D <span class="SpellE">D</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span>Телохранитель,
<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>A</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>Где
твоё тело?<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>У нас
внутри была
птица, <br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">       </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>И я
помню, как
она пела.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Если
б у нас было
время,<br />
Мы бы <span class="SpellE">сдохли</span>
со скуки.<br />
Я нёс тебе то,
что ты
хочешь.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>И
это сожгло
мои руки.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>B</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>+7(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>/</span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>b</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>Ты
делаешь знак
сторожа.<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Gm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>g</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">           
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>#+7(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>Я
делаю знак
лета.<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Fm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                    
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>#<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  </span>Мы оба
знали, где
земля и где
небо,<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">              </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">        </span></span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>E</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span>И мы
погибли в
борьбе за
это.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>B</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>+7(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Am</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>/</span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>b</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    
</span>Скажи
парусу
"смирно",<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Gm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>/</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>g</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>#<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">            
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>#+7(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">     </span>И я
скажу ему
"вольно".<br />
</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>Fm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                          
</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:
EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>#<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes"> 
</span>Большие
деревья
знают, как
вызвать ветер
-<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>)<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">  
</span><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">                     </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">    </span>Одно
слово, и
больше не
будет больно.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Проигрыш:
</span><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>) </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>) </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>G</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>III</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>) </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>(</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>) </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>F</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>Dm</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New"'> </span><span class="SpellE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>E</span></span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'> - 2</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>p</span><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span class="GramE"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>D(</span></span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:
"Courier New";mso-ansi-language:EN-US'>V) A, D(V) A, Am G D, Am G D <span class="SpellE">D</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family:"Courier New";
mso-ansi-language:EN-US'><o:p> </o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><span style='font-family:"Courier New"'>Телохранитель,
<br />
Я знаю, что
тебе снится.<br />
Что ты
вылетаешь из
клетки -<br />
Туда, где
